SUMMARY:SCARS - Open Day
DESCRIPTION:Sunshine Coast Animal Refuge proudly presents “Open Day” We
  will have lots of fun activities and education for families* who want to 
 support rescue cats and dogs and learn how to welcome a new pet into their
  home. Come and enjoy kids’ activities\, education and demonstrations\, 
 guided tours of the Shelter\, a Doggy Kissing Booth\, a charity sausage si
 zzle\, and a coffee van. The SCARS Market will also be open for a special 
 day of sales. ‍As part of the Open Day we will be running our silly Dog 
 Plop Jackpot. Purchase a ticket for a square of land in our dog yard and i
 f one of our rescue dogs plops on your land you will win the jackpot – 2
 0% of the ticket sales. Help us sell all 100 squares of land to raise vita
 l funds for our rescue cats and dogs and make the jackpot reach $10\,000!!
  Purchase your Dog Plop Jackpot ticket here: https://rafflelink.com/r/scar
 s/dogplop26 ‍* We look forward to welcoming visitors of all ages\, but p
 lease note that this will not be an event for family pets to attend. They 
 will be invited back for Santa Paws later this year.
LOCATION:Sunshine Coast Animal Refuge\, 28 Sippy Creek Road
URL:https://www.bwmca.com.au/events-2-1/scars-open-day
